9/04/twitch-drops-blizzcon-2026/"><img class="img-responsive" src="https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/collage_blizzcon2026_twitch_rewards.jpg" style="width: 100%;"/><div style="position: absolute; bottom: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.7); opacity: 1; font-family: Lato, sans-serif !important; font-weight: 400 !important; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.1em; padding: 5px 10px; color: white;">All of the Twitch Drops from BlizzCon 2026</div></a></div></div></div>				<div style="height: 25px;"> </div>
