	<div class="image-container">
		<a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/18/queue-can-believe-friday/" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;thumbnail-click&#39;);">
		<div class="image-bottom-bar"></div>
				<div class="image-bottom-tag">The Queue</div>
		<img width="675" height="380" src="https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wow_forever_hyjal_summit_exterior.jpg" class="header-image img-responsive wp-post-image" alt="" srcset="https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wow_forever_hyjal_summit_exterior.jpg 675w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wow_forever_hyjal_summit_exterior-300x169.jpg 300w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wow_forever_hyjal_summit_exterior-200x113.jpg 200w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wow_forever_hyjal_summit_exterior-80x45.jpg 80w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wow_forever_hyjal_summit_exterior-398x224.jpg 398w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wow_forever_hyjal_summit_exterior-340x191.jpg 340w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wow_forever_hyjal_summit_exterior-620x350.jpg 620w" sizes="(max-width: 675px) 100vw, 675px"/>		</a>
	</div>
	<h2><a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/18/queue-can-believe-friday/" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;title-click&#39;);">The Queue: And if you can believe it, it’s a Friday once again</a></h2>
		<p class="byline">by <a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/author/pulrich/">Phil Ulrich</a> on September 18, 2026 at 1:00pm </p>
		<div class="content">
		<p>It’s Friday! Can you believe it was just <a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/category/blizzcon/">BlizzCon</a> last weekend? Honestly, even as someone who was a somewhat disinterested watcher going into the whole thing, it was hard not to get more than a little excited about some of the stuff that we’ve all discussed endlessly all week around here. Now it’s a new weekend, and I have to shift into a <a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/category/tabletop/">tabletop</a> headspace: I have four games scheduled for this weekend. Pray for my poor brain cells, they’re gonna get worn out by Sunday night.</p>
<p>This is the Queue, our daily question and answer question column where the definition of “question” can get pretty broad, but so can the definition of “answer.” Let’s get into it.</p>
	</div>
	<div style="margin-top: 5px;"><p class="read-more" style=""><a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/18/queue-can-believe-friday/" style="background: #387BBF; color: white; font-weight: bold; padding: 3px 5px 3px 5px; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: 2px; font-family: lato; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px;" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;click-to-read-more&#39;);">Click to read more <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-menu-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></p></div>
	<hr/></article><article class="river" id="waypoint-trigger" style="margin-left: 17px;">
	<div class="image-container">
		<a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/18/blizzard-watch-podcast-blizzcon-mega-episode/" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;thumbnail-click&#39;);">
