				<div class="image-bottom-tag">BlizzCon</div>
		<img width="675" height="380" src="https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/blizzcon_last_call_at_the_arcantina_art.jpg" class="header-image img-responsive wp-post-image" alt="" loading="lazy" srcset="https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/blizzcon_last_call_at_the_arcantina_art.jpg 675w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/blizzcon_last_call_at_the_arcantina_art-300x169.jpg 300w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/blizzcon_last_call_at_the_arcantina_art-200x113.jpg 200w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/blizzcon_last_call_at_the_arcantina_art-80x45.jpg 80w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/blizzcon_last_call_at_the_arcantina_art-398x224.jpg 398w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/blizzcon_last_call_at_the_arcantina_art-340x191.jpg 340w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/blizzcon_last_call_at_the_arcantina_art-620x350.jpg 620w" sizes="(max-width: 675px) 100vw, 675px"/>		</a>
	</div>
	<h2><a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/17/hands-last-call-arcantina-wow-tabletop-experience-exclusive-blizzcon/" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;title-click&#39;);">Hands-on with Last Call at the Arcantina, a WoW tabletop experience exclusive to BlizzCon</a></h2>
		<p class="byline">by <a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/author/eodea/">Eric O&#39;Dea</a> on September 17, 2026 at 3:00pm <a href="https://www.twitter.com/Draygonia_42"> @Draygonia_42</a></p>
		<div class="content">
		One of the least advertised things on the BlizzCon 2026 map was a small area in the World of Warcraft section labeled &#34;Last Call at the Arcantina&#34;.	</div>
	<div style="margin-top: 5px;"><p class="read-more" style=""><a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/17/hands-last-call-arcantina-wow-tabletop-experience-exclusive-blizzcon/" style="background: #387BBF; color: white; font-weight: bold; padding: 3px 5px 3px 5px; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: 2px; font-family: lato; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px;" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;click-to-read-more&#39;);">Click to read more <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-menu-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></p></div>
	<hr/></article><article class="river" style="margin-left: 17px;">
	<div class="image-container">
		<a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/17/the-queue-game-last-forever/" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;thumbnail-click&#39;);">
		<div class="image-bottom-bar"></div>
				<div class="image-bottom-tag">The Queue</div>
		<img width="675" height="380" src="https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wow-forever-dwarf-bear-trailer-still.jpg" class="header-image img-responsive wp-post-image" alt="" loading="lazy" srcset="https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wow-forever-dwarf-bear-trailer-still.jpg 675w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wow-forever-dwarf-bear-trailer-still-300x169.jpg 300w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wow-forever-dwarf-bear-trailer-still-200x113.jpg 200w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wow-forever-dwarf-bear-trailer-still-80x45.jpg 80w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wow-forever-dwarf-bear-trailer-still-398x224.jpg 398w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wow-forever-dwarf-bear-trailer-still-340x191.jpg 340w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wow-forever-dwarf-bear-trailer-still-620x350.jpg 620w" sizes="(max-width: 675px) 100vw, 675px"/>		</a>
	</div>
	<h2><a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/17/the-queue-game-last-forever/" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;title-click&#39;);">The Queue: Can a game really last forever?</a></h2>
		<p class="byline">by <a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/author/eharper/">Elizabeth Harper</a> on September 17, 2026 at 1:00pm </p>
		<div class="content">
		<p>I’m not sure, but after playing <em>World of Warcraft</em> for over 20 years, I’m willing to give it a chance. And we’ll know how things play out very soon, because the beta is scheduled to go live at NQT.</p>
<p>But while we wait (seconds) for that to happen or (hours) for the servers to be stable, let’s get to the questions. This is the Queue, our daily Q&amp;A column.</p>
	</div>
	<div style="margin-top: 5px;"><p class="read-more" style=""><a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/17/the-queue-game-last-forever/" style="background: #387BBF; color: white; font-weight: bold; padding: 3px 5px 3px 5px; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: 2px; font-family: lato; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px;" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;click-to-read-more&#39;);">Click to read more <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-menu-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></p></div>
	<hr/></article><article class="river" style="margin-left: 17px;">
	<div class="image-container">
		<a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/17/world-warcraft-forever-beta/" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;thumbnail-click&#39;);">
		<div class="image-bottom-bar"></div>
				<div class="image-bottom-tag">BlizzCon</div>
		<img width="675" height="380" src="https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/bw-wow-forever-hyjal-zone.jpg" class="header-image img-responsive wp-post-image" alt="" loading="lazy" srcset="https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/bw-wow-forever-hyjal-zone.jpg 675w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/bw-wow-forever-hyjal-zone-300x169.jpg 300w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/bw-wow-forever-hyjal-zone-200x113.jpg 200w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/bw-wow-forever-hyjal-zone-80x45.jpg 80w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/bw-wow-forever-hyjal-zone-398x224.jpg 398w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/bw-wow-forever-hyjal-zone-340x191.jpg 340w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/bw-wow-forever-hyjal-zone-620x350.jpg 620w" sizes="(max-width: 675px) 100vw, 675px"/>		</a>
	</div>
	<h2><a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/17/world-warcraft-forever-beta/" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;title-click&#39;);">How to join the World of Warcraft: Forever beta, which starts on September 17 after the WoW Live Q&amp;A</a></h2>
		<p class="byline">by <a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/author/nmarino/">Nick Marino</a> on September 17, 2026 at 10:45am </p>
		<div class="content">
		World of Warcraft: Forever is bringing new and expanded content and gameplay to Classic Azeroth when it launches worldwide on November 4, 2026 as part of your regular World of Warcraft subscription, no additional purchase necessary!	</div>
	<div style="margin-top: 5px;"><p class="read-more" style=""><a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/17/world-warcraft-forever-beta/" style="background: #387BBF; color: white; font-weight: bold; padding: 3px 5px 3px 5px; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: 2px; font-family: lato; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px;" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;click-to-read-more&#39;);">Click to read more <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-menu-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></p></div>
	<hr/></article><article class="river" style="margin-left: 17px;">
	<div class="image-container">
		<a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/17/tavern-watch-plays-fallout-episode-3-deals-dinosaurs-just-big-chickens/" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;thumbnail-click&#39;);">
		<div class="image-bottom-bar"></div>
				<div class="image-bottom-tag">Podcast</div>
		<img width="675" height="380" src="https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/twp-fallout-ep3.jpg" class="header-image img-responsive wp-post-image" alt="" loading="lazy" srcset="https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/twp-fallout-ep3.jpg 675w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/twp-fallout-ep3-300x169.jpg 300w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/twp-fallout-ep3-200x113.jpg 200w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/twp-fallout-ep3-80x45.jpg 80w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/twp-fallout-ep3-398x224.jpg 398w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/twp-fallout-ep3-340x191.jpg 340w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/twp-fallout-ep3-620x350.jpg 620w" sizes="(max-width: 675px) 100vw, 675px"/>		</a>
	</div>
	<h2><a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/17/tavern-watch-plays-fallout-episode-3-deals-dinosaurs-just-big-chickens/" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;title-click&#39;);">Tavern Watch Plays Fallout, episode 3: Deals with dinosaurs (or just big chickens)</a></h2>
		<p class="byline">by <a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/author/eharper/">Elizabeth Harper</a> on September 17, 2026 at 10:00am </p>
		<div class="content">
		Some days in the Wasteland, you accidentally stumble into a robot-operated dinosaur cloning facility, and then you have to make an ethical judgment on what to do with the lives of intelligent (and very polite) cloned dinosaurs and deathclaws.	</div>
	<div style="margin-top: 5px;"><p class="read-more" style=""><a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/17/tavern-watch-plays-fallout-episode-3-deals-dinosaurs-just-big-chickens/" style="background: #387BBF; color: white; font-weight: bold; padding: 3px 5px 3px 5px; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: 2px; font-family: lato; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px;" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;click-to-read-more&#39;);">Click to read more <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-menu-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></p></div>
	<hr/></article><article class="river" style="margin-left: 17px;">
	<div class="image-container">
		<a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/17/sights-feels-experiences-made-first-ever-blizzcon-worth-trip/" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;thumbnail-click&#39;);">
		<div class="image-bottom-bar"></div>
				<div class="image-bottom-tag">BlizzCon</div>
		<img width="675" height="380" src="https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/blizzcon_2026_sights_eric_selfies.jpeg" class="header-image img-responsive wp-post-image" alt="" loading="lazy" srcset="https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/blizzcon_2026_sights_eric_selfies.jpeg 675w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/blizzcon_2026_sights_eric_selfies-300x169.jpeg 300w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/blizzcon_2026_sights_eric_selfies-200x113.jpeg 200w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/blizzcon_2026_sights_eric_selfies-80x45.jpeg 80w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/blizzcon_2026_sights_eric_selfies-398x224.jpeg 398w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/blizzcon_2026_sights_eric_selfies-340x191.jpeg 340w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/blizzcon_2026_sights_eric_selfies-620x350.jpeg 620w" sizes="(max-width: 675px) 100vw, 675px"/>		</a>
	</div>
	<h2><a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/17/sights-feels-experiences-made-first-ever-blizzcon-worth-trip/" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;title-click&#39;);">All the sights, feels, and experiences that made my first ever BlizzCon worth the trip</a></h2>
		<p class="byline">by <a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/author/eodea/">Eric O&#39;Dea</a> on September 17, 2026 at 9:00am <a href="https://www.twitter.com/Draygonia_42"> @Draygonia_42</a></p>
		<div class="content">
		As you may have deduced by my recent run of BlizzCon coverage, last weekend was my first time attending the event in person.	</div>
	<div style="margin-top: 5px;"><p class="read-more" style=""><a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/17/sights-feels-experiences-made-first-ever-blizzcon-worth-trip/" style="background: #387BBF; color: white; font-weight: bold; padding: 3px 5px 3px 5px; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: 2px; font-family: lato; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px;" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;click-to-read-more&#39;);">Click to read more <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-menu-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></p></div>
	<hr/></article><article class="river" style="margin-left: 17px;">
	<div class="image-container">
		<a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/16/can-expect-future-world-warcraft-classic-progression-servers/" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;thumbnail-click&#39;);">
		<div class="image-bottom-bar"></div>
				<div class="image-bottom-tag">WoW Classic</div>
		<img width="675" height="380" src="https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/bw-dalaran-wotlk-classic-p2.png" class="header-image img-responsive wp-post-image" alt="" loading="lazy" srcset="https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/bw-dalaran-wotlk-classic-p2.png 675w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/bw-dalaran-wotlk-classic-p2-300x169.png 300w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/bw-dalaran-wotlk-classic-p2-200x113.png 200w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/bw-dalaran-wotlk-classic-p2-80x45.png 80w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/bw-dalaran-wotlk-classic-p2-398x224.png 398w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/bw-dalaran-wotlk-classic-p2-620x350.png 620w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/bw-dalaran-wotlk-classic-p2-340x191.png 340w" sizes="(max-width: 675px) 100vw, 675px"/>		</a>
	</div>
	<h2><a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/16/can-expect-future-world-warcraft-classic-progression-servers/" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;title-click&#39;);">What can we expect for the future of World of Warcraft Classic progression servers?</a></h2>
		<p class="byline">by <a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/author/nmarino/">Nick Marino</a> on September 16, 2026 at 7:00pm </p>
		<div class="content">
		Throughout BlizzCon 2026, we received plenty of information and news about the huge reveal of World of Warcraft: Forever, the roadmap for the rest World of Warcraft: Midnight, and even teasers for The Last Titan and Wrath of the Lich King Remix.	</div>
	<div style="margin-top: 5px;"><p class="read-more" style=""><a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/16/can-expect-future-world-warcraft-classic-progression-servers/" style="background: #387BBF; color: white; font-weight: bold; padding: 3px 5px 3px 5px; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: 2px; font-family: lato; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px;" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;click-to-read-more&#39;);">Click to read more <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-menu-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></p></div>
	<hr/></article><article class="river" style="margin-left: 17px;">
	<div class="image-container">
		<a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/16/skyborne-classes-factions/" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;thumbnail-click&#39;);">
		<div class="image-bottom-bar"></div>
				<div class="image-bottom-tag">BlizzCon</div>
