		<p class="byline">by <a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/author/ted/">Ted Atchley</a> on September 16, 2026 at 1:30pm <a href="https://www.twitter.com/honorshammer"> @honorshammer</a></p>
		<div class="content">
		Hey now, you&#39;re an all-star, get your game on, go play.	</div>
